  "formulation": {
    "model_family": "比较24小时季节性、168小时季节性与凸Huber回归；验证选模后以168..2375重训，在2376..2399测试。实际任务采用全时域确定性构造和有限冲突回溯。；确定性新能源优先分流与有界单任务局部搜索；候选必须完整复算并通过硬约束。输出best-found、non-Pareto且无全局最优证书。；先计算无储能比较状态，再独立进行含储能全时域前向可行构造和有界局部搜索；无储能状态不可行不截断含储能搜索。；全时域联合可行构造及有界交替局部搜索；12000次评价由基准和全部情景共享，并受同一285秒搜索硬截止及300秒总截止约束。",
    "objectives": [
      {
        "id": "OBJ-Q1",
        "meaning": "令D_{rkt}=sum_{i:o_i=r,k_i=k,a_i=t}g_i。Huber候选使用u_{rkt}=beta_0+sum_{l in {1,2,3,24,48,168}}beta_l D'_{rk,t-l}+gamma^T z_t+alpha_r+delta_k，在t=168..2351上最小化sum rho_delta((D_{rkt}-u_{rkt})/sigma_{rk})+lambda||theta||_2^2；z_t=[sin(2*pi*t/24),cos(2*pi*t/24),sin(2*pi*t/168),cos(2*pi*t/168)]，训练后才取Dhat=max(0,u)。基础调度按等待、时延、峰值GPU利用率及固定词典序构造可行incumbent。",
        "unit": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "OBJ-Q2",
        "meaning": "从q1可行incumbent出发，评价最多N_move^{q2}=20000个单任务迁移或开工变更。对完整可行候选的成本、碳排、有效网络时延、新能源未利用率和等待量，以相对基准真实差值的有限正中位数d_j标准化，Psi_m=sum_j w_j(a_{jm}-a_{j,m0})/d_j；无正尺度维度退出评分。",
        "unit": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "OBJ-Q3",
        "meaning": "固定Baseline_AI_IT_Load_MW和NonAI_IT_Load_MW。无储能方案仅作为比较基准，不是含储能可行性的启动条件。直接构造含储能incumbent，并对最多N_move^{q3}=12000个完整候选按成本、碳排、非负峰值净购电、绝对爬坡和有效新能源未利用率的有限正差值尺度评分。",
        "unit": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "OBJ-Q4",
        "meaning": "独立构造并审计联合任务—储能—电力incumbent，不因q3无储能比较基线不可行而停止。基准联合搜索及全部情景共享N_move,total^{q4}=12000次完整候选评价；评分使用成本、碳排、有效网络时延、有效等待损失、有效新能源未利用率和六区域非负峰值的有限正中位绝对差尺度。",
        "unit": ""
      }
    ],
    "constraints": [
      {
        "id": "CON-Q1-1",
        "meaning": "h_i=d_i/60；F_i=min(valid LatestFinishHour,2406)；Omega_i={(r,s):s为0..2405整数，s>=a_i，s+h_i<=F_i，ell_{o_i r}<=ell_i^max，omega_{i,2406}(s)=0}；Omega_i为空时结构化停止。",
        "hard": true
      },
      {
        "id": "CON-Q1-2",
        "meaning": "omega_{it}(s)=max(0,min(t+1,s+h_i)-max(t,s))；chi_{it}(s)=1{omega_{it}(s)>0}；sum_{(r,s) in Omega_i}x_{irs}=1；实时任务s_i=a_i。",
        "hard": true
      },
      {
        "id": "CON-Q1-3",
        "meaning": "sum_{i,s}g_i chi_{it}(s)x_{irs}<=G_r^max；L_N+sum g_i p_{k_i}^{GPU}chi x<=P_r^{IT,max}；PUE乘同一IT负荷<=P_r^{F,max}。",
        "hard": true
      },
      {
        "id": "CON-Q1-4",
        "meaning": "E_{rt}^{AI}=sum g_i p_{k_i}^{GPU}omega x；L_{rt}^{AI,avg}=E_{rt}^{AI}/Delta t；能源计算采用omega，容量审计采用chi。",
        "hard": true
      },
      {
        "id": "CON-Q1-5",
        "meaning": "U_{rt}^{peak}=sum g_i chi x/G_r^max；U_{rt}^{avg}=sum g_i omega x/(G_r^max Delta t)。仅在G_r^max>0时计算；否则两项输出metric_unavailable。甘特图容量审计固定采用U_peak，同时输出U_avg。",
        "hard": true
      },
      {
        "id": "CON-Q1-6",
        "meaning": "MAE和RMSE直接计算；WAPE仅在sum|y|>0时计算，否则输出metric_unavailable并退出选模排序。",
        "hard": true
      },
      {
        "id": "CON-Q1-7",
        "meaning": "完整候选域确定性构造；冲突回溯最多N_back=2000节点。达到节点上限或D_search仍无完整方案时输出feasibility_unresolved。",
        "hard": true
      },
      {
        "id": "CON-Q2-1",
        "meaning": "执行q1的唯一执行、实时开工、截止、单向时延、chi瞬时GPU/IT/设施容量和omega小时能源约束。",
        "hard": true
      },
      {
        "id": "CON-Q2-2",
        "meaning": "问题二无储能：R_ch=G_ch=C=D=0；R_use+R_sell+R_curt=R_av；G_buy+R_use=L_F_avg；G_sell=R_sell。",
        "hard": true
      },
      {
        "id": "CON-Q2-3",
        "meaning": "0<=G_buy<=I_r^max y_grid；0<=G_sell<=X_r^{grid}(1-y_grid)。问题二不读取SellLimit_MW或SOC。",
        "hard": true
      },
      {
        "id": "CON-Q2-4",
        "meaning": "R_use=min(R_av,L_F_avg)；若负荷不足部分购电，若新能源富余则先在X_r^{grid}内外送、其余弃电；购电超过I_r^max的候选不可行。",
        "hard": true
      },
      {
        "id": "CON-Q2-5",
        "meaning": "C_op=sum(c_buy G_buy-c_sell G_sell)Delta t；E_CO2=sum kappa G_buy Delta t。",
        "hard": true
      },
      {
        "id": "CON-Q2-6",
        "meaning": "L_net仅在W_net=sum_i g_i h_i>0时取sum_i g_i h_i ell_{o_i r_i}/W_net；U_RE仅在W_RE=sum R_av Delta t>0时取sum(R_use+R_ch+R_sell)Delta t/W_RE；否则输出metric_unavailable并删除对应评分维。",
        "hard": true
      },
      {
        "id": "CON-Q3-1",
        "meaning": "L_F_avg=PUE_r(L_BAI+L_N)；R_use+R_ch+R_sell+R_curt=R_av；G_load+R_use+D=L_F_avg；C=R_ch+G_ch；G_buy=G_load+G_ch；G_sell=R_sell。",
        "hard": true
      },
      {
        "id": "CON-Q3-2",
        "meaning": "S_{r,-1}=S_r^0；S_{rt}=S_{r,t-1}+eta_c C Delta t-D Delta t/eta_d；S_min<=S<=S_max；S_{r,2406}>=S_r^0。",
        "hard": true
      },
      {
        "id": "CON-Q3-3",
        "meaning": "0<=C<=C_max；0<=D<=D_max；每小时动作仅为idle、charge或discharge。0<=G_buy<=I_r^max y_grid；0<=G_sell<=min(X_r^{grid},X_r^{storage})(1-y_grid)。",
        "hard": true
      },
      {
        "id": "CON-Q3-4",
        "meaning": "无储能基线若违反购电上限，记录no_storage_baseline_infeasible，但继续从S_{r,-1}=S_r^0构造含储能方案；只有含储能构造在D_search前未取得完整可行incumbent时输出feasibility_unresolved。",
        "hard": true
      },
      {
        "id": "CON-Q3-5",
        "meaning": "每次动作后检查S_{rt}+sum_{u=t+1}^{2406}eta_c C_r^max Delta t>=S_r^0，并完整前推检查购电上限、能源守恒、SOC、功率、互斥和终端SOC。",
        "hard": true
      },
      {
        "id": "CON-Q3-6",
        "meaning": "N=G_buy-G_sell；P_peak=max(0,max_t N)；V=sum_{t=1}^{2406}|N_t-N_{t-1}|；EFC=sum(C+D)Delta t/(2B_r)仅在B_r>0时计算。",
        "hard": true
      },
      {
        "id": "CON-Q3-7",
        "meaning": "U_RE仅在sum R_av Delta t>0时计算；否则输出metric_unavailable并退出评分。",
        "hard": true
      },
      {
        "id": "CON-Q4-1",
        "meaning": "任务侧执行q1全部硬约束；能源与储能侧执行q3的能源守恒、SOC、终端SOC、功率、购售互斥及充放互斥约束；问题四外送上限为min(MaxGridExport_MW,SellLimit_MW)。",
        "hard": true
      },
      {
        "id": "CON-Q4-2",
        "meaning": "联合初始方案必须从S_{r,-1}=S_r^0独立全时域构造；q3的no_storage_baseline_infeasible不构成停止条件。若联合可行构造在声明预算内失败，输出feasibility_unresolved。",
        "hard": true
      },
      {
        "id": "CON-Q4-3",
        "meaning": "Q_RT、Q_SLA、Q_deadline及Q_wait均先检查各自分母；前三项为硬约束审计，评分仅使用分母为正且存在候选差异的1-Q_wait。L_net和U_RE同样执行正分母门禁。",
        "hard": true
      },
      {
        "id": "CON-Q4-4",
        "meaning": "碳目标rho_C in {0,0.1,0.2,0.3}；峰谷价差delta_P in {0.75,1,1.25}；售电乘数delta_S in {0,0.5,1}；新能源水平delta_R in {0.8,1,1.2}；波动场景seed=2026且R_av,vol=max(0,R_av+sigma xi)。",
        "hard": true
      },
      {
        "id": "CON-Q4-5",
        "meaning": "各具体情景从同一联合基线独立重构，但候选计数器n_move^{q4}跨基准和所有情景累计，必须满足sum_m n_m<=12000；达到共享上限或D_search后未运行的情景输出not_run_budget_exhausted。",
        "hard": true
      },
      {
        "id": "CON-Q4-6",
        "meaning": "所有候选开始前及可中断循环内部检查time.monotonic()<D_search；达到D_search立即中断并丢弃当前未完成候选。D_search之后只允许文件输出、完整审计和状态整理。",
        "hard": true
      }
    ]
  },
